SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Ali Murphy
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE A SONG FROM ALI’S SONG LIST \nMAKE A REQUEST HERE! \nTAG and TIP YOUR PIANIST! IG: @alimurphymusic Venmo: @alimurphymusic \nAli Murphy is a gifted pianist\, singer\, and songwriter from Lancaster\, PA with a passion for great music. Since the age of nine\, Ali has learned to play pretty much every genre of music from classical to jazz to pop. She recently graduated from the Frost School of Music at the University of Miami with her B.M. in  Music Industry\, and is now based in Nashville to pursue music full-time. She helped kick off Music for Everyone’s Keys to the City program in Lancaster\, and has appeared three years in a row at the Launch Music Conference/Festival. She’s performed with many artists including John Splithoff\, Jillian Dawn\, M’Lynn\, Orlando Mendes\, and Alyce.
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-ali-murphy-2/2026-05-15/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/12/Ali-Murphy-1-scaled.jpeg
END:VEVENT
