SUMMARY:Show Tunes at Sid's
DESCRIPTION:COME SING SHOW TUNES WITH YOUR FRIENDS!!! Every Monday\, the inimitable Megan Murphy Chambers hosts a celebration of the music of Broadway w/Jamey Green at the piano. Open mic\, group sings\, special guests\, spontaneous kick lines… who knows what else??? Come sing along!!!  CLICK HERE TO MAKE A REQUEST! \n\n\n\nTIP YOUR HOST & PIANIST! They’ll split it Venmo: @Megan-Chambers-15
