SUMMARY:Showtune Singalong: On The Town with Jack Lipson!
DESCRIPTION:8 PM\, sing along to classic tunes from “On The Town”! \nThen stick around to sing a song from Jack’s extensive catalog of show tunes! \nHow it works:\nTip Jack!\nCheck out the song list!\nMake a request!\nDoors at 7 PM\, Broadway Karaoke starts at 7:30.\n\nMulti-musical-hyphenate Jack Lipson “bounds toward what’s next in the world of sound.” The Los Angeles native has piano’ed and sung supporting Idina Menzel\, Darren Criss\, Josh Groban\, Andrew Rannells and many more at venues from The Hollywood Bowl to Disney Hall. He co-writes music\, lyrics\, and -stars alongside his twin brother in Jack & Benny Lipson’s “sensational\, clever\, and astute” revues that have played NY (Birdland\, Club Cumming\, etc.)\, LA (Luckman Fine Arts\, residency at Lyric Hyperion Theater\, etc.)\, Chicago\, San Diego\, and San Francisco. Lipson has produced and arranged-orchestrated concerts for the LA Phil\, albums by Pia Toscano and Bethany Joy Lenz\, and recently composed the score and theme to zenroom starring Cheri Oteri. He participates in the BMI Lehmann Engel Musical Theater Workshop.
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/musical-monday-with-jack-lipson-7-2-7/
LOCATION:New York Sid Gold’s Request Room\, 165 W 26th St\, New York\, NY\, 10001\, United States
CATEGORIES:New York Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/5.18.26.OnTheTown.png
GEO:40.7459164;-73.9936869
