SUMMARY:RomComIRL
DESCRIPTION:The Reckless Romantics Present:\n\nROM COM IRL: The Improv Musical Rom Com Dating Show\nOne single contestant lives out the plot of a musical rom com (made up by you\, the audience) to find real love!\nYou’ll set the scene\, we’ll set the song\, and together we will make our protagonist fall in love Hollywood style!\nThere will be COMEDY\, there will be DRAMA\, there will be… dance battles?\nYOU DECIDE!\nAbove all\,\n…There will be love.\n\nFeaturing your hosts Tess Richie and Alex Petrullo.\nSpecial Guest Meg Millane\nAnd of course\, Joe McGinty on the keys!\n\nDOORS OPEN 7pm!\n7:30pm Pre Show Entertainment\n7:45pm Showtime!\n\nTickets Here!
