SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Mick Khoury
DESCRIPTION:CHOOSE A SONG FROM MICK’S SONG LIST \nREQUEST A SONG \nTip your pianist! VENMO: @MickKhoury \nMick Khoury is the accompanist for the Hamilton Sing-A-Long show at Sid Gold’s and is thrilled to accompany YOU during Piano Karaoke! Outside of Sid’s\, you can find him playing piano and singing for Cherry Bomb: An Improvised Musical\, playing synthesizers for the local artist\, Basic Printer\, or performing his own original music around town. With a wide background in Musical Theater\, Pop Hits\, and Karaoke Classics\, he’s ready to bring the house down every time he takes his seat at Sid Gold’s piano! Follow along at @MickKhoury on Instagram or TikTok 🙂
